<a:t>What’s new!</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-GB"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="accent1"><a:lumMod val="75000"/></a:schemeClr></a:solidFill></a:endParaRPr></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="5" name="Text Placeholder 4"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{975D981F-4EAF-7805-B9C7-0ABB2D25850F}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph type="subTitle" sz="quarter" idx="11"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr/><p:txBody><a:bodyPr/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-GB"/><a:t>Frontier Accelerate for Copilot</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="4" name="Text Placeholder 3"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{B81C012B-0FCF-FDD2-8825-EE230C69ADE2}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph sz="quarter" idx="12"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="576072" y="2345713"/><a:ext cx="4129492" cy="4093728"/></a:xfrm></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr vert="horz" wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="t"><a:noAutofit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1600" dirty="0"/><a:t>New Frontier Accelerate post-sales engagement for FY27!</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" dirty="0"/><a:t>This FY27 Agent Solution Deployment Accelerator is focused on building agentic solutions leveraging Copilot Studio, Microsoft Foundry, Agents SDK, and Agent 365 SDK, Power Platform and/or managing them with Agent 365, a governed platform.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" dirty="0"/><a:t>This accelerator maintains the flexible engagement structure from FY26. </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Segoe Sans Display Semibold" pitchFamily="2" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Segoe Sans Display Semibold" pitchFamily="2" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>FY27 MCI eligibility includes SME&amp;C expansion. Please review the MCI Incentives Guide for this year’s partner and customer eligibility criteria. </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="accent1"><a:lumMod val="75000"/></a:schemeClr></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Segoe Sans Display Semibold" pitchFamily="2" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Segoe Sans Display Semibold" pitchFamily="2" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>New updates!</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="accent1"><a:lumMod val="75000"/></a:schemeClr></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Segoe Sans Display Semibold" pitchFamily="2" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Segoe Sans Display Semibold" pitchFamily="2" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>New Copilot Cowork Engagement Delivery Guidance</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="accent1"><a:lumMod val="75000"/></a:schemeClr></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Segoe Sans Display Semibold" pitchFamily="2" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Segoe Sans Display Semibold" pitchFamily="2" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>New Agent 365 PoC Kit</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1"/><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Segoe Sans Display Semibold" pitchFamily="2" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Segoe Sans Display Semibold" pitchFamily="2" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="8" name="Text Placeholder 7"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{70D1497C-40BF-E596-2E8D-898A17492EEF}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph sz="quarter" idx="13"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="5304749" y="2345713"/><a:ext cx="4363378" cy="4093728"/></a:xfrm></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr vert="horz" wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="t"><a:noAutofit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1600" dirty="0"><a:cs typeface="Segoe Sans Display"/></a:rPr><a:t>Ways to build, secure, and govern agents in this accelerator</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="accent1"><a:lumMod val="75000"/></a:schemeClr></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Segoe Sans Display Semibold" pitchFamily="2" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Segoe Sans Display Semibold" pitchFamily="2" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Copilot Studio </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" dirty="0"/><a:t>– Low-code authoring for agents, with knowledge grounding, tools/actions, and flexible channel publishing.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="accent1"><a:lumMod val="75000"/></a:schemeClr></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Segoe Sans Display Semibold" pitchFamily="2" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Segoe Sans Display Semibold" pitchFamily="2" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Microsoft Foundry </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" dirty="0"/><a:t>– Pro-code path for prompt, workflow, or hosted agents with custom models and stable endpoints.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="accent1"><a:lumMod val="75000"/></a:schemeClr></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Segoe Sans Display Semibold" pitchFamily="2" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Segoe Sans Display Semibold" pitchFamily="2" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Agent 365 SDK </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" dirty="0"/><a:t>– Create new agents and bring third-party and existing agents into Agent 365 with built-in identity, Work IQ tooling, telemetry, and controlled Microsoft 365 access.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="accent1"><a:lumMod val="75000"/></a:schemeClr></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Segoe Sans Display Semibold" pitchFamily="2" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Segoe Sans Display Semibold" pitchFamily="2" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Custom Declarative / Agents SDK </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" dirty="0"/><a:t>– Agent Builder in Microsoft 365 Copilot, Agents Toolkit, or the Microsoft 365 Agents SDK for declarative or custom-engine agents.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="accent1"><a:lumMod val="75000"/></a:schemeClr></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Segoe Sans Display Semibold" pitchFamily="2" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Segoe Sans Display Semibold" pitchFamily="2" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Power Platform </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" dirty="0"/><a:t>– Power Apps, Power Automate flows, and Dataverse-backed solutions for scalable, automated workflows.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="accent1"><a:lumMod val="75000"/></a:schemeClr></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Segoe Sans Display Semibold" pitchFamily="2" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Segoe Sans Display Semibold" pitchFamily="2" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Agent 365 </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" dirty="0"/><a:t>– Governed control plane for registry, identity, security, observability, and lifecycle management.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1"/><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1"/><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1"/><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" d